{"3574640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Little Tank World", "steam_appid": 3574640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Tank World</strong>, a turn-based strategic party game where toy tanks clash in a child’s bedroom turned into a miniature battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/extras/a2380c759e61a7edcd26e19d706417d1.poster.avif?t=1760780556\" width=1170 height=428 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/extras/a2380c759e61a7edcd26e19d706417d1.webm?t=1760780556\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574640/extras/a2380c759e61a7edcd26e19d706417d1.mp4?t=1760780556\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple yet tactical gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each player commands a squad of toy tanks, planning movements and attacks every turn. Anticipation and precision are the keys to victory.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun multiplayer modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local play</strong>: Perfect for friendly matches on the same screen.<br><strong>Online play</strong>: Challenge other players and prove your strategic skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A playful and colorful world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battles come to life among toys, blocks, and familiar objects. The lighthearted atmosphere makes the game accessible to all kinds of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re a born strategist or just looking for some fun with friends, <strong>Little Tank World</strong> delivers action-packed battles full of energy and good vibes!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Little Tank World</st